  "limits": [
    "Angle margin is angular distance from gap centre minus half gap, not physical Euclidean pin/band clearance.",
    "PartData.GapAngleDeg is the logical gap; ring.gapAngle is serialized mesh geometry. They can differ. Closed logic owners have no logical gap edge and are counted separately.",
    "Pin angleDeg and ring.gapDirection are in owner-local coordinates, so world rotation cancels. No pin ownership inferred from pixels or target positions.",
    "Counts are authored asset occurrences, not deduplicated campaign layouts or active runtime locks.",
    "This audit does not choose an aesthetic threshold or override GD's review; new research pin margin >=45 is a design guard, not a discovered law of the original game."
